    "_postman_id": "834af00d-0793-4700-b836-55397144a7ee",
    "name": "Microsoft Edge DevTools Protocol HTTP API",
    "description": "HTTP endpoints for the Microsoft Edge DevTools Protocol, based on the Chromium DevTools Protocol. These endpoints allow programmatic discovery and management of debuggable browser targets including pages, service workers, and extensions. The HTTP API serves as the entry point for establishing WebSocket debugging connections to individual targets.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Edge Developer",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
